cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this fact graph, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Weak Oertel conjecture fact graph"
authors:
  - family-names: Cheng
    given-names: Hongyu
  - family-names: Kerger
    given-names: Phillip
abstract: >-
  A fact graph for the weak Oertel conjecture on mixed-integer halfspace
  depth: statements with proofs, their dependencies, and the verification
  records that approved them, with Lean formalizations and exact-arithmetic
  checkers for counterexamples to Oertel's conjecture and to the 1/e bound.
repository-code: "https://github.com/Hongyu-Cheng/weak-oertel-conjecture"
license:
  - CC-BY-4.0
  - MIT
keywords:
  - Oertel's conjecture
  - mixed-integer centerpoints
  - halfspace depth
  - fact graph
  - Lean 4
references:
  - type: unpublished
    title: "A counterexample to Oertel's conjecture on mixed-integer centerpoints"
    authors:
      - family-names: Cheng
        given-names: Hongyu
      - family-names: Kerger
